<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" xml:lang="en-US">
  <id>tag:github.com,2008:https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases</id>
  <link type="text/html" rel="alternate" href="https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases"/>
  <link type="application/atom+xml" rel="self" href="https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases.atom"/>
  <title>Release notes from claude-code</title>
  <updated>2026-10-23T23:38:44Z</updated>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/937253475/v2.1.310</id>
    <updated>2026-10-23T23:39:00Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.310"/>
    <title>v2.1.310</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added the Monitor tool and plugin monitors on Bedrock, Vertex, and Foundry, and when telemetry or nonessential traffic is disabled; long foreground sleeps are now blocked there too&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed requests failing behind some gateways and compatible servers that reject the &lt;code&gt;effort-2025-11-24&lt;/code&gt; beta value or mid-conversation system messages; Claude Code now retries without them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed background cleanup deleting some recent files, such as pasted images, when &lt;code&gt;cleanupPeriodDays&lt;/code&gt; is set to a very large value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed compaction after a &quot;Prompt is too long&quot; error keeping too much of a conversation with dense text, such as base64 or SVG, so the next request could fail again&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed file read permission prompts not showing where a symbolic link leads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed a question&#39;s auto-continue timeout firing the moment the external editor closed after a long edit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Windows: Fixed PreToolUse and PermissionRequest hooks letting a tool call through when Git Bash is missing and the hook&#39;s command is only quoted strings, such as a quoted path&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved auto mode&#39;s prompt before the first read outside the working directories: it now says when blocking those reads makes shell commands ask for permission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved memory use of non-interactive sessions (&lt;code&gt;-p&lt;/code&gt;, Agent SDK) during compaction when the transcript file is very large&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved a mod&#39;s &lt;code&gt;Image&lt;/code&gt; to draw inside tmux with &lt;code&gt;allow-passthrough&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;focus-events&lt;/code&gt; on, in kitty, Ghostty, and iTerm2 3.5+ with fullscreen rendering, where it showed only its &lt;code&gt;alt&lt;/code&gt; text&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Linux: Improved &lt;code&gt;/sandbox&lt;/code&gt; and the sandbox startup warning to name Ubuntu&#39;s AppArmor restriction on user namespaces, and how to lift it, when it keeps bubblewrap from starting the sandbox&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changed the error for an MCP tool call that times out in a non-interactive session while the server&#39;s elicitation is unanswered: it now tells Claude that no answer came and not to repeat the call&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Fixed pressing Enter on the plan review card&#39;s &quot;Send feedback and keep planning&quot; button approving the plan instead of sending your comments back&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Fixed the panel showing &quot;Something went wrong&quot; after &quot;Switch branch &amp;amp; continue&quot; on a cloud session opened from Session history&#39;s Web tab&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Cloud sessions] Added Claude Code cloud sessions and Remote Control permissions to Enterprise custom roles, so Owners can control access to each by role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Cloud sessions] Added a Choose file button to load a cloud environment&#39;s setup script from a file&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Cloud sessions] Fixed failed saves and archives in the cloud environment edit dialog showing no error inside the dialog&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Cloud sessions] Fixed failed routine API token actions showing only a toast; the error now appears in the routine edit dialog&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Cloud sessions] Improved the session start checklist to show a cloud environment&#39;s setup script output in a scrolling box&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Cloud sessions] Changed turning on Cloud sessions or Remote Control in admin settings to ask for confirmation and list the custom roles that have that permission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Cloud sessions] Changed the cloud environment dialog to open network access, setup script and environment variables from rows instead of listing every editor at once&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Claude Tag] Fixed Claude Tag treating &lt;code&gt;!&lt;/code&gt; commands such as &lt;code&gt;!restart&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;!help&lt;/code&gt; as ordinary messages when sent in bold, italic or strikethrough&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Claude Tag] Fixed Claude Tag admin channel and workspace pages being replaced by a load error when a background refresh of the bundle list fails&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Claude Tag] Fixed Claude Tag&#39;s spend limits page in admin settings reporting that no channels match a filter while channel names are still loading&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Code Review] Fixed the Code Review admin section hiding its repositories and switches after a failed refresh of the repository list&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Code Review] Improved the Code Review admin section to retry the first load and show one Try again banner when it still fails&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
    <author>
      <name>ashwin-ant</name>
    </author>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178951676?s=60&amp;v=4"/>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/937253475/v2.1.309</id>
    <updated>2026-10-22T22:18:57Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.309"/>
    <title>v2.1.309</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed sandboxed Bash commands on macOS and Linux running the shell&#39;s startup files outside the sandbox before each command&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed macOS sandbox &lt;code&gt;denyWrite&lt;/code&gt; glob patterns not applying at a path&#39;s real location when the pattern&#39;s folder is reached through a symlink&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed sandboxed commands and auto-accepted edits being able to modify the MCP config file passed with &lt;code&gt;--mcp-config&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed a disabled MCP server being reconnected by a later permission prompt in print and SDK sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed the Bash permission check trusting a variable set by a command whose redirect can fail to open&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed Bash permission checks not prompting for some compound commands that change directory before running git when the &lt;code&gt;cd&lt;/code&gt; is wrapped or prefixed, as they do for a plain &lt;code&gt;cd&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed an &lt;code&gt;Edit(path)&lt;/code&gt; deny rule not blocking a Bash redirect to that path in some commands that also held a subshell&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed worktree-isolated sessions accepting some locale-prefixed commands the isolation guard should refuse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed worktree-isolated sessions on zsh accepting some arithmetic commands that the isolation guard should refuse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed worktrees and branch checkouts that Claude Code creates so they ignore git replace refs, as its other git operations already do&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed profile store write protection not applying when the config directory is reached through a symlink&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed sessions compacting repeatedly after reading files under a very large nested CLAUDE.md; a nested CLAUDE.md over the size limit now loads only its start&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed ctrl+enter (send now) only queuing a message when pressed before the response had started, and restarting a prompt&#39;s hooks while leaving the message queued when pressed while those hooks were running&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed key-bound slash commands running in the shell from &lt;code&gt;!&lt;/code&gt; mode&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed ctrl+o not showing messages from other agents and sessions that are still waiting to be delivered; they now appear in full under the transcript, marked as waiting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed long tool output previews being cut through an emoji, leaving session transcripts that &lt;code&gt;jq&lt;/code&gt; could not parse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed Read reporting &quot;File does not exist&quot; for PDF page ranges in Linux sandboxes that share the parent&#39;s &lt;code&gt;/proc&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed messages from a Claude Desktop-hosted session sometimes being lost when its connection refreshed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed features missing from Claude Code sessions in the Claude desktop app when the terminal on the same computer was signed in to a different account or organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed the &lt;code&gt;claude remote-control&lt;/code&gt; status line showing &lt;code&gt;HEAD&lt;/code&gt; as the branch for a folder that is not in a git repository&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed split-pane agent teammates not inheriting the tool deny and &lt;code&gt;--tools&lt;/code&gt; rules given on the leader&#39;s command line&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed sessions renamed with &lt;code&gt;/rename&lt;/code&gt; appearing to other sessions under a generated name after a VS Code window reload or a non-interactive &lt;code&gt;--resume&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed the &lt;code&gt;/rewind&lt;/code&gt; list showing &quot;No code changes&quot; for a turn that changed checkpointed files through &lt;code&gt;/code-review --fix&lt;/code&gt;, a subagent or a shell command&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed &lt;code&gt;/privacy-settings&lt;/code&gt; showing an out-of-date &quot;Help improve our AI models&quot; value; it now also says when the setting can&#39;t be fetched&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed feedback saying &quot;try again later&quot; when your organization does not accept feedback; it now shows the server&#39;s reason and where to report a bug&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed oversized /feedback reports failing instead of being resent without the transcript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed a skill in an &lt;code&gt;--add-dir&lt;/code&gt; folder being unreachable when another skill already held its name; it is now offered as &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;folder&amp;gt;:&amp;lt;name&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed &lt;code&gt;/verify&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;/code-review&lt;/code&gt; not finding a nested package&#39;s own skill when its files were changed from the shell&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed the /claude-api skill saying that &lt;code&gt;ant beta:worker poll --on-work&lt;/code&gt; passes trace context to the command&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed the /claude-api skill&#39;s C# tracing setup missing spans from the cloud platform clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed the /claude-api skill saying that API spans for requests to Claude Platform on AWS can&#39;t join the caller&#39;s trace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed hooks that run in PowerShell not blocking when the hook&#39;s program exits with code 2, and on Windows &lt;code&gt;PreToolUse&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;PermissionRequest&lt;/code&gt; hooks with &lt;code&gt;&quot;shell&quot;: &quot;powershell&quot;&lt;/code&gt; failing open when Git for Windows isn&#39;t installed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed a mod&#39;s &lt;code&gt;turn.step&lt;/code&gt; hook that names a model by alias, such as &lt;code&gt;haiku&lt;/code&gt;, failing every request with a model error: the alias now resolves to its model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed plugins and skills synced from claude.ai being removed, sometimes mid-session, after a disk read error&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed artifact publishes and updates being refused for some ordinary pages, such as pages with certain minified scripts or artifacts Claude could not read first&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed Claude asking for permission on each artifact update for the rest of a turn after the conversation was compacted in that turn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed fine-grained tool streaming staying off on Amazon Bedrock when &lt;code&gt;ANTHROPIC_BEDROCK_BASE_URL&lt;/code&gt; is set to the default &lt;code&gt;bedrock-runtime.&amp;lt;region&amp;gt;.amazonaws.com&lt;/code&gt; endpoint&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed the &quot;Waiting for API response&quot; hint flickering behind gateways that send only keepalive pings: routes off Anthropic&#39;s backend now wait 45 seconds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed Claude notifying unrelated GitHub users by writing role names and placeholders as mentions in PRs, issues and comments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Linux: Fixed sandbox write denies lifting when a background command outlived the session&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Windows: Fixed PowerShell permission checks auto-approving some &lt;code&gt;Set-Location&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code&gt;cd&lt;/code&gt; commands that target the current directory and carry extra arguments; these now prompt for approval&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;macOS: Fixed the &quot;Install Command Line Developer Tools&quot; dialog opening each time Claude Code starts on a Mac without Xcode or the Command Line Tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-hosted runner: Fixed &lt;code&gt;--startup-timeout-min&lt;/code&gt; stopping a session whose first prompt, such as &lt;code&gt;/code-review&lt;/code&gt;, was still working in a subagent; a frozen process is still stopped&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved the speed of many git commands Claude Code runs for itself on Windows; on every platform, errors from those commands now show in English even when git is set to another language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved the error when a hooks module is nested too deep to load: it now names the file instead of showing a bare stack-overflow message&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved disk-full handling: a Bash command cut off by a full disk now says so and names the folder to free up, and starting on a full temp volume prints a clear message, not a raw ENOSPC error&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved the /claude-api skill to offer API tracing alongside SDK tracing when asked to add OpenTelemetry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved the /claude-api skill to check the live docs before saying a feature is unsupported&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-hosted runner: Improved sessions that move to a new runner: Claude now sees the tool call that was interrupted, marked as outcome unknown&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Updated the bundled dataviz skill to accept APCA as a text-contrast measure (keeping WCAG 2 ratios where AA conformance is required), add an &lt;code&gt;apca(text, background)&lt;/code&gt; function to its palette validator scripts, and say whether a label inside a colored chart fill should be white or near-black&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Updated the /claude-api skill: service account keys and Workload Identity Federation tokens can now manage OpenTelemetry destinations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changed &lt;code&gt;sed -i&lt;/code&gt; to get the standard Bash prompt and run as written, not a simulated file-edit preview; like other Bash edits, it is no longer restored by &lt;code&gt;/rewind&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changed &lt;code&gt;claude ultrareview&lt;/code&gt; to require workspace trust: it asks on a terminal, else refuses; scripts pass &lt;code&gt;--trust-workspace&lt;/code&gt;, which takes no value (put a PR number or base branch before it), or set &lt;code&gt;CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_ULTRAREVIEW_TRUST_CHECK=1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changed the dangerous &lt;code&gt;rm&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;rmdir&lt;/code&gt; prompt in bypass permissions mode in the Desktop app and VS Code to deny the command at once with a rewrite hint, so unattended sessions keep going&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changed commands the settings exclude from the sandbox to ask before writing to its write-list paths while the sandbox is enabled but cannot run; the unsandboxed fallback is refused there&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changed worktree creation and reuse so git no longer fetches objects on demand, in ordinary clones and in partial clones with a Bash sandbox configured; such a partial clone fetches them first&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changed the &lt;code&gt;/claude-api&lt;/code&gt; skill to build Managed Agents subagent teams on &lt;code&gt;multiagent_20261001&lt;/code&gt; with dynamic workflows on by default, instead of &lt;code&gt;coordinator&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Added a log warning that says what to do when dictation or the extension&#39;s own requests fail certificate verification, such as behind a TLS-inspecting proxy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Fixed the Claude panel staying blank after the editor cached an incomplete copy of its files; it now recovers by itself, or says what went wrong and how to fix it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Fixed Session history filling up with empty &quot;Untitled&quot; sessions each time you start a new session without sending a message&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Fixed long slash-command messages such as &lt;code&gt;/goal&lt;/code&gt; filling the chat panel; they now fold behind Show more like other prompts (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5595521927&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/issues/97469&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/anthropics/claude-code/issues/97469/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/issues/97469&quot;&gt;#97469&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Fixed long messages not folding behind Show more after the chat panel is made narrower&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Fixed Ctrl+J in the chat input always inserting a newline: it is now left to VS Code and the OS when &quot;ctrl+j&quot; is set to null in the Chat context of ~/.claude/keybindings.json&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Fixed a mod&#39;s &quot;From the … plugin&quot; label above the prompt being drawn over the slash command and @-mention menus (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5897869454&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/issues/102981&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/anthropics/claude-code/issues/102981/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/issues/102981&quot;&gt;#102981&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Fixed an empty list item, paragraph or code block, and list items renumbered from 1, when pasting copied LaTeX math&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Fixed the feedback error showing only an HTTP status when your organization does not accept feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Improved Edit and Write speed in the chat panel: the wait for new problems after each edit is now 0.75 seconds in most cases, down from 1 to 1.5 seconds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Cloud sessions] Fixed the Add connector list in routine forms saying no connectors were available while they were still loading&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Cloud sessions] Fixed the cloud environment editor shuffling environment variables and adding backslashes to values that contain both kinds of quote&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Cloud sessions] Fixed the self-hosted environment details dialog in admin settings so its title, tabs and buttons stay in view while only the content scrolls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Cloud sessions] Fixed the &quot;read documentation&quot; tool row in cloud sessions, which showed escaped JSON instead of a readable page&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Cloud sessions] Improved a cloud session&#39;s Changes pane, which now says when it lists only pushed commits or only Claude&#39;s edits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Claude Tag] Fixed Claude in Slack posting a draft you approved for a channel into your DM by mistake; a post with no channel is now refused so it can go to the approved channel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Claude Tag] Fixed Allow and Deny on Claude&#39;s approval cards in Slack doing nothing when the session had stopped; your answer now restarts the session&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Claude Tag] Fixed Claude ignoring untagged messages in a Slack channel after its workspace moved to a different Claude organization, including unshared channels on Enterprise Grid&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Claude Tag] Fixed Claude in a Slack channel posting a threaded reply before reading a newer message someone had just added to that thread&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Claude Tag] Fixed the Slack page in Claude Tag admin settings saying no workspaces were connected when the list failed to load; it now shows an error with a Retry button&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Code Review] Fixed a finished review showing no check on the pull request when earlier tries to create it failed; a final try now adds a completed check&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Code Review] Fixed a push queued behind a running review still starting a review after &lt;code&gt;@claude review stop&lt;/code&gt;; its check now closes and says why&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
    <author>
      <name>ashwin-ant</name>
    </author>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178951676?s=60&amp;v=4"/>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/937253475/v2.1.308</id>
    <updated>2026-10-22T04:34:55Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.308"/>
    <title>v2.1.308</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bug fixes and reliability improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
    <author>
      <name>ashwin-ant</name>
    </author>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178951676?s=60&amp;v=4"/>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/937253475/v2.1.307</id>
    <updated>2026-10-21T22:17:02Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.307"/>
    <title>v2.1.307</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;/claude-api api-version&lt;/code&gt; to move Claude API code to API version &lt;code&gt;2026-10-21&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added the &lt;code&gt;claude_code.safety_event&lt;/code&gt; OpenTelemetry event for each tool call a permission rule, auto mode, a safety check, a hook or the sandbox stopped, prompted or sent back&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed requests failing with a model-not-found error when &lt;code&gt;CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_1M_CONTEXT&lt;/code&gt; is set and the model is an alias with the &lt;code&gt;[1m]&lt;/code&gt; suffix, such as &lt;code&gt;opus[1m]&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed the &lt;code&gt;prompt-caching-scope&lt;/code&gt; beta header being sent behind custom &lt;code&gt;ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL&lt;/code&gt; gateways and on Foundry, where it has no effect&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed MCP servers showing &quot;needs authentication&quot; in &lt;code&gt;claude -p&lt;/code&gt; on macOS while the login keychain was locked; they now say why, and the next run after an unlock connects without a new sign-in&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed MCP servers being reported as timed out, and staying failed in headless runs, when a macOS or Linux computer went to sleep while they were connecting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed HTTP MCP tool calls being sent twice when the connection closed mid-call; only read-only or idempotent tools are now retried&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed a turn sometimes starting without an SDK MCP server&#39;s latest tools when a background task was running&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed some &quot;Autocompact is thrashing&quot; errors in turns that read many PDF pages, images or other large tool results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed &lt;code&gt;/autocompact&lt;/code&gt; in cloud sessions going back to the default window after the session restarted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed a conversation cleared with &lt;code&gt;/clear&lt;/code&gt; sometimes coming back when a cloud or self-hosted runner session restarted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed &lt;code&gt;CLAUDE_STREAM_FIRST_BYTE_TIMEOUT_MS&lt;/code&gt; being ignored in Claude apps gateway sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed telemetry from Claude Desktop sessions behind a Claude apps gateway being rejected when &lt;code&gt;OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_HEADERS&lt;/code&gt; is set&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed &lt;code&gt;/permissions&lt;/code&gt; &amp;gt; Recently denied not showing the denied shell command, and auto mode&#39;s local classifier ignoring an approval from there when it checks a retried command; approving a row now names the command, not its description&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed &lt;code&gt;/help&lt;/code&gt; and the &lt;code&gt;/&lt;/code&gt; command menu showing long model-facing descriptions for bundled skills such as &lt;code&gt;/claude-api&lt;/code&gt; instead of their short descriptions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed subagent transcripts recording placeholder token usage and an empty stop reason for streamed responses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed model switches through the Agent SDK&#39;s &lt;code&gt;setModel()&lt;/code&gt;, and apps built on it, being refused when the API took more than 5 seconds to confirm the model; Claude Code now waits up to 15 seconds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed a background command stopped through a connected app (such as the desktop app archiving an idle session) being reported to Claude as stopped by the user; the notice now names its output file&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed WebFetch in Cowork cloud sessions reporting a tool error when a site answered with a 4xx status or a robots.txt refusal; it is now a normal result, as in local sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed write tools on a directly configured GitHub MCP server showing a form that closed without creating anything in the desktop app&#39;s Code tab&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed Artifact tool reads failing with a connection reset when the server had closed a reused connection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-hosted runner: Fixed sessions with &lt;code&gt;--use-anthropic-git-proxy&lt;/code&gt; committing a &lt;code&gt;.claude/settings.local.json&lt;/code&gt; left in the clone by an earlier session&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-hosted runner: Fixed archiving or requeueing a session, or stopping the runner, during its checkout hook leaving the hook&#39;s processes running and the runner&#39;s slot held&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved recovery from unparseable tool calls: Claude Code now retries the call up to twice before ending the turn with an error&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved fork subagents launched together: each is now told which launch is its own, so forks are much less likely to try to start each other&#39;s work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved browser sign-in: the success page now appears as soon as sign-in completes, without waiting for your account profile to load&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved web search errors in cloud and self-hosted runner sessions: a search refused with a 403 that gives a reason now shows that reason instead of a generic &quot;Authentication error&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved the time to the first reply in cloud sessions when one of the desktop app&#39;s MCP servers can&#39;t connect&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved Remote Control connect time for sessions whose transcript contains large pasted images or PDF reads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changed the notice Claude gets when the WebSearch budget is used up to also tell it not to query search engines in a browser or through computer use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changed the &lt;code&gt;axScreenReader&lt;/code&gt; setting and &lt;code&gt;CLAUDE_AX_SCREEN_READER&lt;/code&gt; in a settings &lt;code&gt;env&lt;/code&gt; block to apply only from user, managed or &lt;code&gt;--settings&lt;/code&gt; settings (since 2.1.305)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-hosted runner: Changed checkout hooks to be stopped after 30 minutes by default, failing the session&#39;s setup; if yours needs longer, raise &lt;code&gt;--checkout-hook-timeout-min&lt;/code&gt; or set it to &lt;code&gt;0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-hosted runner: Changed the certificate file built for Anthropic-managed git to filter its trusted certificates as the CLI does; a &lt;code&gt;[runner:warn]&lt;/code&gt; line gives the number left out&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Added a notice on the microphone button when voice dictation stops by itself (15 seconds without recognized speech, or the 2-minute limit), saying why and that the text so far is kept&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Fixed a long prompt expanded with Show more covering the whole chat panel: a pinned prompt is now capped at 40% of the panel and scrolls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Fixed part of a list item or table cell with LaTeX math pasting as a new list or table in rich text editors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Fixed dictation failing behind a TLS-inspecting proxy when &lt;code&gt;NODE_EXTRA_CA_CERTS&lt;/code&gt; is set only in &lt;code&gt;~/.claude/settings.json&lt;/code&gt;; it now also follows &lt;code&gt;CLAUDE_CODE_CERT_STORE&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Changed the &quot;still open somewhere else&quot; notice to also cover a Claude process left over from an extension restart, which usually ends on its own within about 10 minutes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Changed voice dictation to filter its trusted certificates as the CLI does&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Changed the extension&#39;s own requests to filter their trusted certificates as the CLI does, and to trust the &lt;code&gt;NODE_EXTRA_CA_CERTS&lt;/code&gt; file named in the environment or in user settings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Cloud sessions] Fixed the repository picker saying &quot;No repositories match&quot; while a search was still running; it now shows &quot;Searching…&quot; until the results arrive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Cloud sessions] Fixed the &quot;Waiting for a runner&quot; status on self-hosted environments being cut off; with on-demand runners it now counts up from your last message and shows failed attempts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Code Review] Added &lt;code&gt;@claude review stop&lt;/code&gt; (also &lt;code&gt;off&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;pause&lt;/code&gt;) to Code Review, ending an &lt;code&gt;@claude review always&lt;/code&gt; subscription on a pull request without starting a new review&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
    <author>
      <name>ashwin-ant</name>
    </author>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178951676?s=60&amp;v=4"/>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/937253475/v2.1.306</id>
    <updated>2026-10-21T03:16:31Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.306"/>
    <title>v2.1.306</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed &lt;code&gt;claude -p&lt;/code&gt; inside cloud sessions reporting &quot;Not logged in&quot; when started without the session&#39;s environment variables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed an API error being replaced by &quot;prompt is too long&quot;, and an unneeded compaction, in sessions with many MCP tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
    <author>
      <name>ashwin-ant</name>
    </author>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178951676?s=60&amp;v=4"/>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/937253475/v2.1.305</id>
    <updated>2026-10-20T20:46:50Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.305"/>
    <title>v2.1.305</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;sandbox.allowNestedUserNamespaces&lt;/code&gt; so sandboxed commands on Linux can create user namespaces (Chromium, rootless podman); this lets them get around the sandbox&#39;s file protections&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;CLAUDE_CODE_RETRY_WATCHDOG_USAGE_LIMIT_RECHECK_MS&lt;/code&gt; so unattended retry mode (&lt;code&gt;CLAUDE_CODE_RETRY_WATCHDOG&lt;/code&gt;) notices a usage limit that was lifted before its reset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed every request failing on Vertex, Bedrock and other providers when the endpoint or a gateway rejects tool search, and behind gateways with ToolSearch disallowed or left out of &lt;code&gt;--tools&lt;/code&gt; (a 2.1.304 regression): Claude Code now retries without it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed &lt;code&gt;/effort&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;/autocompact&lt;/code&gt; settings not applying when the model name differed from a &lt;code&gt;modelOverrides&lt;/code&gt; value by letter case or a &lt;code&gt;[1m]&lt;/code&gt; tag&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed new worktrees in a bare repository sometimes starting from local HEAD instead of the default branch, and unchanged subagent worktrees sometimes not being cleaned up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed Bash commands on a full disk failing with a raw &lt;code&gt;ENOSPC&lt;/code&gt; file path: the error now says the disk is full and that nothing ran&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed an MCP server passed by a cloud session or by the SDK&#39;s &lt;code&gt;setMcpServers&lt;/code&gt; being replaced later in the session by a same-named server from your own settings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed Claude naming the wrong model for a subagent&#39;s work after the subagent switched to a fallback model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed cloud sessions and teammates not telling Claude when a compaction had to leave the oldest messages out of its summary to fit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed more cases of scheduled Cowork cloud sessions waiting five minutes for each subagent whose WebFetch needed a URL approval that nobody was there to give&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed Workflow resume re-running already-completed &lt;code&gt;pipeline()&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;parallel()&lt;/code&gt; agents instead of serving them from the run&#39;s journal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed Remote Control leaving empty &quot;(session)&quot; entries in &lt;code&gt;/resume&lt;/code&gt; after switching conversations with &lt;code&gt;/resume&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed &lt;code&gt;/usage&lt;/code&gt; rows being cut off in narrow terminals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed startup warnings printing as raw text above the logo: they now go to the debug log, and permission rules that restrict nothing show as warning rows under the banner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed screen reader mode: search boxes now say &quot;Search:&quot; instead of a symbol VoiceOver read as &quot;telephone recorder&quot;, and highlighted prompt text, such as Ctrl+R search matches and &quot;ultrathink&quot;, no longer has spaces inside words&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-hosted runner: Fixed a start script that shares only its stdout with the runner or orchestrator failing with &lt;code&gt;Resource temporarily unavailable&lt;/code&gt; when &lt;code&gt;TERM&lt;/code&gt; is set (a 2.1.300 regression)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-hosted runner: Fixed repository access failing since 2.1.296 when a git credential helper or askpass program reads its settings through &lt;code&gt;GIT_CONFIG&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-hosted runner: Fixed the orchestrator reporting a spawn-runner hook as timed out when a runner it started in the background kept its output open&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved &lt;code&gt;/usage&lt;/code&gt;: each warning is now a one-line fix that names its source, and &lt;code&gt;f&lt;/code&gt; applies the fixes; the same fixes appear in VS Code and &lt;code&gt;/doctor&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved MCP consent dialogs so an Enter meant for the prompt is less likely to be taken as Accept&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved a mod&#39;s &lt;code&gt;Image&lt;/code&gt; to draw its picture in iTerm2 3.5 and later with fullscreen rendering, where it showed only its &lt;code&gt;alt&lt;/code&gt; text&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote Control: Improved the spawn-mode messages: pressing &lt;code&gt;w&lt;/code&gt; now says the new mode is saved for the folder, and a later &lt;code&gt;claude remote-control&lt;/code&gt; start that uses the saved mode says where it came from&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changed &lt;code&gt;allowedMcpServers&lt;/code&gt; to stop filtering &lt;code&gt;managed-mcp.json&lt;/code&gt; stdio servers that use &lt;code&gt;${VAR}&lt;/code&gt; only in &lt;code&gt;env&lt;/code&gt;: one your allowlist left out now loads on upgrade; use &lt;code&gt;deniedMcpServers&lt;/code&gt; to keep it off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changed plugins that Claude Desktop mounts by path to no longer keep their &lt;code&gt;allowed-tools&lt;/code&gt; when your organization&#39;s managed settings set &lt;code&gt;allowManagedPermissionRulesOnly&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changed the &lt;code&gt;/artifacts&lt;/code&gt; delete confirmation to take 1 or Enter to keep, 2 to delete, and Esc to cancel; &lt;code&gt;y&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;n&lt;/code&gt; no longer answer it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changed a mod&#39;s docked pane to stay within 45% of the terminal&#39;s width, including a width kept from a wider terminal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Added a &quot;Running start-up hooks&quot; spinner status, with a screen reader announcement, while SessionStart or Setup hooks run&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Fixed the spinner cutting off &quot;Compacting...&quot; when your &lt;code&gt;spinnerVerbs&lt;/code&gt; setting replaces the built-in verbs with short ones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Changed the message shown when a session does not start in time and no hook is running: it now leads with the output logs and lists causes instead of pointing to sign-in and network first&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Cloud sessions] Fixed the Cloud environments admin page wrongly refusing to save an existing environment with an &quot;installs packages&quot; error&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Cloud sessions] Improved deleting a self-hosted environment so the dialog and error messages say what blocks the delete and what it will affect&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Claude Tag] Added public Slack channels Claude hasn&#39;t joined to the Claude Tag admin Add place search, so admins can set one up from there&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Claude Tag] Fixed Claude Tag access bundles so a repository that moved to another GitHub account can be added again&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Claude Tag] Fixed a routine set up in a Slack DM thread no longer posting after another routine in that thread restarted the conversation; both now keep posting there&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Claude Tag] Fixed routines set up in a Slack thread reporting success without posting after the conversation ended; those runs are now skipped and the creator is told&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Claude Tag] Improved Claude Tag admin pages in large organizations so plugin, skill and bundle edits work while the channel list is still loading&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Code Review] Fixed Code Review sometimes not reviewing the newest commit when several pushes landed on a pull request during a review&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Code Review] Changed Code Review re-reviews so they no longer open with LGTM while earlier blocking findings are still open&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
    <author>
      <name>ashwin-ant</name>
    </author>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178951676?s=60&amp;v=4"/>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/937253475/v2.1.304</id>
    <updated>2026-10-19T21:34:39Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.304"/>
    <title>v2.1.304</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added a transcript line when a plugin that runs first skips one of your mod&#39;s hooks, naming the event and the plugin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;decider: &quot;person&quot;&lt;/code&gt; to a mod&#39;s &lt;code&gt;tool.check&lt;/code&gt; answer: only the permission dialog or a host&#39;s callback can approve the ask, and it is refused with the mod&#39;s reason where nobody can be asked&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;e.isReadOnly&lt;/code&gt; to a mod&#39;s &lt;code&gt;tool.check&lt;/code&gt; event, set when the tool call is read-only&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;/auto-mode-setup&lt;/code&gt;: a guided setup that reads your project and recent sessions to teach auto mode about your environment, now also available on Bedrock, Vertex, Foundry, Claude apps gateway and telemetry-disabled sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;/claude-api managed-agents-secure&lt;/code&gt;, which compares a Managed Agents agent&#39;s settings with Anthropic&#39;s published security guide, without changing anything&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added the names of the tools called earlier to the compaction summary in the transcript view (Ctrl+O)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added a warning on Pro and Max plans when resuming an inactive conversation would use a noticeable share of your 5-hour usage limit: resume anyway, or start a new conversation and Claude can look up the previous one if you refer to it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed the organization policy not refreshing until the hourly check after approving an &lt;code&gt;ANTHROPIC_API_KEY&lt;/code&gt; at startup or switching &quot;Use custom API key&quot; in &lt;code&gt;/config&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed sandboxed commands failing to start on Linux when a &lt;code&gt;sandbox.filesystem.denyRead&lt;/code&gt; glob contains brackets that are not a character class, such as a &lt;code&gt;[user-id]&lt;/code&gt; route folder&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed &lt;code&gt;rm -r&lt;/code&gt; of a mounted drive or a folder at its top level (&lt;code&gt;/Volumes&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;/media&lt;/code&gt;, WSL&#39;s &lt;code&gt;/mnt/c&lt;/code&gt;) not getting the safety prompt that &lt;code&gt;rm -rf /Applications&lt;/code&gt; gets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed &lt;code&gt;CLAUDE_CODE_TRANSCRIPT_LOCAL_GC&lt;/code&gt; dropping messages from the saved transcript when the disk filled up while the file was being trimmed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed a plugin keeping a headless run going past &lt;code&gt;--max-turns&lt;/code&gt;, Stop, or ended input by spawning subagents or re-running a finished one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed a failed mod reload removing the tools and commands of the version that stays loaded, and its messages being wrong or silent about whether the previous version is still loaded&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed a click on a mod&#39;s button being lost when buttons with the same label and no &lt;code&gt;key&lt;/code&gt; were redrawn unchanged&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed mod sharing in the built-in &lt;code&gt;plugin-authoring&lt;/code&gt; skill stopping at the secret scan on machines with managed settings and on Team and Enterprise plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed scheduled Cowork cloud sessions waiting five minutes again for each subagent whose WebFetch needed a URL approval that nobody was there to give&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed Write results and rejected edits showing a file outside the working directory as &lt;code&gt;../../…&lt;/code&gt;; they now show &lt;code&gt;~/…&lt;/code&gt; or the full path&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed a claude.ai Directory plugin&#39;s skills not running as commands when picked from the &quot;/&quot; menu in Cowork cloud sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed Remote Control permanently withholding a desktop conversation&#39;s history when a different account was signed in to the terminal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed Remote Control failing to start from Claude Desktop when DISABLE_TELEMETRY or DO_NOT_TRACK is set on a paid plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed model switches, messages and interrupts waiting behind a context usage check in SDK and desktop sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed &lt;code&gt;context_management: Extra inputs are not permitted&lt;/code&gt; errors behind LLM gateways; Claude Code now resends the request without that field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed OpenTelemetry settings delivered through server-managed settings being ignored for the whole session after signing in during first-run setup or the first start after /logout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed unsandboxed Bash commands in Claude Desktop Code tab sessions on macOS and Linux not seeing environment variables exported in shell startup files such as ~/.zshrc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed the Consumer Terms notice being skipped for a day or longer after a server error&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed &lt;code&gt;/privacy-settings&lt;/code&gt; offering choices that may not apply to you after a network or server error&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed a &quot;Context limit reached&quot; or &quot;Prompt is too long&quot; error after stopping a turn while Claude Code was compacting a conversation the API had rejected as too long&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed subagents sometimes forgetting their most recent work when they were messaged or resumed right after finishing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed &lt;code&gt;claude --help&lt;/code&gt; text for &lt;code&gt;--tools&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;--resume&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;--debug&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;--json-schema&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;--disable-slash-commands&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;--system-prompt-snapshot&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;claude update&lt;/code&gt; to match actual behavior&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed &lt;code&gt;claude --worktree&lt;/code&gt; removing the worktree and its branch without asking at exit when HEAD was detached or on another branch, which could lose commits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed resumed and cloud sessions sending Claude the whole skill list again each time plugins reloaded at startup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed an interrupt not ending a Read that waits on an idle pipe or device named like an image&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed &lt;code&gt;/effort status&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;/effort ultracode&lt;/code&gt; and the prompt&#39;s effort indicator showing a guessed effort level when &lt;code&gt;CLAUDE_CODE_EFFORT_LEVEL&lt;/code&gt; is &lt;code&gt;auto&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code&gt;unset&lt;/code&gt; and no level is sent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed a PreToolUse hook&#39;s deny reason being replaced by a timeout error when an Agent SDK callback hook on the same tool call timed out&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed Bash and PowerShell deleting a large command&#39;s output file when it could not be copied to the session&#39;s tool-results folder, unless the disk is full&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed notes typed into a multiple-choice question with previews being cut off with &quot;…&quot; in terminals under about 100 columns, hiding what was typed (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5025726790&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/issues/82768&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/anthropics/claude-code/issues/82768/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/issues/82768&quot;&gt;#82768&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed self-paced &lt;code&gt;/loop&lt;/code&gt; wakeups scheduled at the 1-hour maximum firing just after the 1-hour prompt cache expired, so those wakeups no longer re-read the conversation uncached&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed agent teams: approving a shutdown request from the main session no longer exits the whole CLI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed a skill&#39;s &lt;code&gt;once&lt;/code&gt; hook also removing another skill&#39;s identical hook after it ran&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed transcript mode&#39;s &lt;code&gt;{&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;}&lt;/code&gt; landing the prompt on an inconsistent row, or off screen, instead of the transcript&#39;s first row&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed &lt;code&gt;CLAUDE_CODE_AUTO_COMPACT_WINDOW=200k&lt;/code&gt; silently setting a 100K window: the variable now accepts &lt;code&gt;k&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;M&lt;/code&gt; suffixes like &lt;code&gt;--autocompact&lt;/code&gt;, and warns when a value is out of range or ignored&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed Ctrl+C in the agents view clearing a text selection without copying it when pressed before the mouse button was released&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved &lt;code&gt;/usage&lt;/code&gt; to say when a rate limit on usage data ends instead of &quot;try again in a moment&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved the lines shown when a mod written in the session loads, reloads or fails to load&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved artifacts with several views: when you ask for links to them, Claude now writes out each view&#39;s link and explains that the address bar stays the same as you switch views&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved cloud sessions: a new conversation&#39;s first turn no longer waits for the local (stdio) MCP servers of plugins synced from claude.ai, unless a server sets &lt;code&gt;alwaysLoad: true&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved how a remote session recovers its status when the server refuses a status update that carried other session data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved session file size in auto mode: the safety classifier&#39;s context is no longer stored with every request&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved the &lt;code&gt;claude -p&lt;/code&gt; invalid-settings warning: a file that did not load lists only what stopped it, and long lists are capped per file&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved resume of large compacted sessions in SDK and headless mode: the first request after resuming is sent sooner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved responsiveness and throughput when many subagents are running at the same time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved memory use when sending requests in long or resumed conversations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-hosted runner: Improved the error shown when the git host answers &quot;not found&quot; for a session&#39;s repository: it now names the repository and whom to ask&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Windows: Improved git command start-up with a standard Git for Windows install by running its git.exe directly instead of through its cmd launcher&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changed mods&#39; &lt;code&gt;settings.read&lt;/code&gt; hooks to receive each settings layer and rewrite the merged settings, so a managed mod can make an organization&#39;s setting a ceiling, including the &lt;code&gt;cleanupPeriodDays&lt;/code&gt; the retention sweep uses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changed the &lt;code&gt;/artifacts&lt;/code&gt; delete confirmation to show numbered choices: 1 or Enter keeps the artifact, 2 deletes it, and y, n and Esc still work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changed the question that turns on the mods Claude writes in a session to plain text with no link or session id; it stays up when a new turn starts, and Claude tells you what loaded when you turn them on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changed tool search to be on by default behind a custom &lt;code&gt;ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL&lt;/code&gt;; a 400 or 422 from the gateway is retried without it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changed compaction to send Claude the skill list again afterwards; &lt;code&gt;/reload-skills&lt;/code&gt; now sends only new or changed skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changed skill hooks: the skills of one source (a repo, your own folder, or a plugin) can register at most 1,024 hooks and 16,384 matcher characters per session&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changed skills under a policy that allows hooks from plugins only: a skill used in the main conversation whose hooks are kept out no longer gets its &lt;code&gt;allowed-tools&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Updated the /claude-api skill to use the &lt;code&gt;ant&lt;/code&gt; CLI on Claude Platform on AWS instead of falling back to the SDK or curl&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Removed the notes from &lt;code&gt;claude plugin validate&lt;/code&gt; that predicted where a mod&#39;s hooks would run&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Removed the &quot;(research preview)&quot; label from the &lt;code&gt;/fast&lt;/code&gt; dialog title on Opus 5.5&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Added mod drawing in the chat panel for sessions on Amazon Bedrock, Google Vertex AI and Microsoft Foundry, behind an LLM gateway, or with telemetry turned off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Fixed one cause of sessions failing to start with &quot;Subprocess initialization did not complete within 60000ms&quot;: time a SessionStart command hook spends running no longer counts toward the limit, up to 10 minutes in total&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Fixed a session closed while it was starting keeping its Claude Code process running until the start ended&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Fixed a mod&#39;s drawings disappearing from a long-open panel until the next turn on machines that also run an older Claude Code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Fixed Past conversations hiding sessions when &lt;code&gt;claudeCode.claudeProcessWrapper&lt;/code&gt; is set&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Changed background sub-agents to show as one status line under their Agent card instead of streaming every step into the chat; the full transcript stays in /tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Cloud sessions] Fixed folders in the composer&#39;s @ list showing no name in cloud sessions, where picking one added only a space instead of a mention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Claude Tag] Fixed Claude going silent in a thread when its channel becomes shared across Enterprise Grid workspaces mid-task; it now posts a one-time note to @-mention it in a new thread&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Claude Tag] Fixed &lt;code&gt;@Claude !fork&lt;/code&gt; typed outside a thread getting no visible reply; Claude now shows you a private note saying to run it from inside a thread&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Code Review] Added review levels to Code Review: Owners choose Quick, Standard (the default), or Deep for the organization, and can give individual repositories their own level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Code Review] Added an option in Code Review admin settings to review every repository in a GitHub organization, including ones added later, without selecting them one by one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Code Review] Fixed pull requests opened within a minute or two of an admin turning on Code Review being silently skipped; they are now retried and reviewed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
    <author>
      <name>ashwin-ant</name>
    </author>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178951676?s=60&amp;v=4"/>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/937253475/v2.1.303</id>
    <updated>2026-10-18T22:26:54Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.303"/>
    <title>v2.1.303</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bug fixes and reliability improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
    <author>
      <name>ashwin-ant</name>
    </author>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178951676?s=60&amp;v=4"/>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/937253475/v2.1.302</id>
    <updated>2026-10-16T20:53:06Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.302"/>
    <title>v2.1.302</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;CLAUDE_CODE_AUTO_MODE_MODEL&lt;/code&gt; to choose the model the client-side auto mode classifier uses; it does not change the model for server-side auto mode&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added an &lt;code&gt;Idle compaction&lt;/code&gt; row to &lt;code&gt;/config&lt;/code&gt; for turning idle compaction off or back on; the notices shown after an idle compaction now say how to turn it off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added a notice to &lt;code&gt;/design-sync&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;/design-login&lt;/code&gt; that standalone Claude Design (claude.ai/design) closes by December 14, 2026&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed a &quot;Prompt is too long&quot; error when stopping a turn while the conversation was being compacted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed requests failing with &quot;diagnostics: Extra inputs are not permitted&quot; after switching to Vertex or Bedrock mid-session&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed the Read tool loading an image file of any size, or a pipe or device named like an image, entirely into memory; image sources over 128 MB are now refused&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed &lt;code&gt;/autocompact&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;/effort&lt;/code&gt; saving to the wrong model when a gateway names Opus 4 or 4.1 with a prefix, such as &lt;code&gt;anthropic/claude-opus-4-1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed a prompt cache miss when a tool added mid-session was loaded again through ToolSearch or after compaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed &lt;code&gt;claude plugin&lt;/code&gt; and other subcommands sometimes exiting before a queued settings or config write finished, which could lose the change or leave a &lt;code&gt;.tmp&lt;/code&gt; file behind&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed plugin marketplaces re-cloning on every refresh, and newly installed git plugins showing version &quot;unknown&quot;, when git defaults to the reftable ref format&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed the PowerShell tool not finding commands in a plugin&#39;s &lt;code&gt;bin/&lt;/code&gt; folder, and reporting an error when a search that finds nothing (rg, grep, findstr, git grep) is piped into &lt;code&gt;Select-Object&lt;/code&gt; or another formatting cmdlet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed Claude in the desktop app pointing you to claude.ai settings or &lt;code&gt;/mcp&lt;/code&gt; to authorize or reconnect an MCP server where that option isn&#39;t available&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed artifact publishes sometimes failing when Claude sent an empty list of edits, and Claude retrying an artifact update the wrong way after a newer version of the artifact turned it away&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed &lt;code&gt;classifier_category&lt;/code&gt; missing from OpenTelemetry &lt;code&gt;tool_decision&lt;/code&gt; events for most auto mode classifier blocks, and new &lt;code&gt;tool_decision&lt;/code&gt; attributes pushing out &lt;code&gt;tool_use_id&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;tool_source&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;tool_parameters&lt;/code&gt; when &lt;code&gt;OTEL_LOGRECORD_ATTRIBUTE_COUNT_LIMIT&lt;/code&gt; is low&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed rows in the agents view staying blank after moving down a long list or folding a section&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed &lt;code&gt;claude remote-control --help&lt;/code&gt; not printing its usage and exiting when not signed in&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed &lt;code&gt;/design consent&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;/design revoke&lt;/code&gt; suggesting &lt;code&gt;/design-login&lt;/code&gt; when they fail in a cloud session, where it isn&#39;t available; the message now points to claude.ai/design/settings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed MCP servers showing no tools, or every tool call failing, when the server negotiates protocol version 2026-07-28 but omits &lt;code&gt;resultType&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;ttlMs&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code&gt;cacheScope&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed prompt suggestions spending usage credits on models your plan pays for only with credits: they are now skipped after a reply billed to credits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed URLs written in backticks being clickable only on their first row when they wrap; the whole URL is now one link in terminals that support hyperlinks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed &lt;code&gt;claude plugin details &amp;lt;name&amp;gt;@builtin&lt;/code&gt; suggesting &lt;code&gt;claude plugin list&lt;/code&gt;, which never shows built-in plugins, when the plugin isn&#39;t found; it now points to &lt;code&gt;/plugin&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed an emoji that a link starts inside wrapping one column too wide, which hid it in question previews and turned tables into lists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed worktree isolation refusing to create or resume worktrees under git 2.56 or later when a stray &lt;code&gt;.git&lt;/code&gt; file points at a directory that doesn&#39;t exist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed a cloud session&#39;s cost and usage restarting from zero after the session resumed in a new process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-hosted runner: Fixed git fetches failing with &quot;bad object refs/heads&quot; in sessions that reuse a checkout stored in git&#39;s reftable format&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Windows: Fixed every file write being refused or asked about for projects on exFAT or FAT32 drives, including in sessions started with &lt;code&gt;--plugin-dir&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved startup time with many plugins enabled: plugin command and agent files now take far fewer file system calls to load, most of all on Windows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved auto mode with the server-side classifier: a conversation too long for the safety check is now compacted, instead of every checked tool call being denied&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved the message when a background session reopened from another folder has no LLM gateway: it now says why, instead of &quot;Not logged in&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changed &lt;code&gt;claude -p&lt;/code&gt; and Agent SDK sessions with no permission mode to start in &lt;code&gt;default&lt;/code&gt; mode on third-party providers, with telemetry off or on a fresh install; &lt;code&gt;--permission-mode auto&lt;/code&gt; keeps auto&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changed fork subagents (&lt;code&gt;subagent_type: &quot;fork&quot;&lt;/code&gt;) to be on by default in &lt;code&gt;claude -p&lt;/code&gt;, the Agent SDK, the desktop app and VS Code, as they already are in the terminal; &lt;code&gt;CLAUDE_CODE_FORK_SUBAGENT=0&lt;/code&gt; turns them off, and &lt;code&gt;claude mcp serve&lt;/code&gt; never offers them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changed the desktop app and VS Code to always run the main conversation&#39;s subagents in the background, as the terminal does, rather than let Claude choose; a subagent&#39;s own Agent calls in &lt;code&gt;claude -p&lt;/code&gt;, the Agent SDK, the desktop app and VS Code now run in the foreground by default&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changed the &lt;code&gt;← for agents&lt;/code&gt; footer hint to hide 10 seconds after a session opens; the count of agents waiting on you still shows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changed where the Claude in Chrome instructions sit in the system prompt so that new conversations can read them from the shared prompt cache&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changed prompt and agent hooks so that at most 12 of one event run at a time; the rest wait their turn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changed the message shown when your organization&#39;s policy turns off &lt;code&gt;/feedback&lt;/code&gt;: it now points to GitHub issues instead of an organization admin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Fixed text after an unclosed code block in a list showing as plain text while a reply streams, then turning into code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Fixed MCP server sign-in from the panel opening a broken authorization page when the server URL contains a query string&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Fixed the &lt;code&gt;@browser&lt;/code&gt; banner saying &quot;Browser connected&quot; when no browser with the Claude extension can be reached&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Cloud sessions] Added a banner on a routine&#39;s page that says why its last run didn&#39;t start, such as your organization reaching its limit on concurrent cloud sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Cloud sessions] Fixed &quot;Rewind to here&quot; failing on every message except the newest in cloud sessions; self-hosted runners need Claude Code v2.1.246 or later&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Cloud sessions] Fixed the pull request status bar in cloud sessions flipping a pull request with merge conflicts back to ready while GitHub rechecked it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Cloud sessions] Fixed routine runs showing as Completed after their cloud session stopped unexpectedly, and as Cancelled when archived before they started, instead of failed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Cloud sessions] Fixed the diff view in cloud sessions missing changes or failing to load after the session&#39;s GitHub repository was renamed or moved&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Cloud sessions] Fixed a scheduled routine run that failed partway being run again from the start an hour or more later, which could repeat work such as posting the same report twice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Cloud sessions] Fixed an open cloud session sometimes not showing messages sent from another device until you reloaded the page or clicked away and back&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Cloud sessions] Improved the error shown when a cloud session fails to start: it now says &quot;Connection lost&quot; or &quot;Server error&quot; instead of &quot;Something went wrong&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Remote Control] Fixed a subagent&#39;s pane spinning forever in a Remote Control session after your computer goes offline; it now says Remote Control is disconnected&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Claude Tag] Fixed &quot;is thinking…&quot; staying up under a mention in a Slack channel or DM after Claude answered it by editing one of its earlier messages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Claude Tag] Fixed URLs in code blocks under a numbered or bulleted step of Claude&#39;s Slack replies being wrapped in angle brackets, which broke copied commands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Claude Tag] Fixed HEIC, SVG, TIFF and BMP images attached in Slack never reaching Claude; they now arrive as files in its working files, like other file types&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Claude Tag] Fixed new channel managers losing access to Claude in Slack in organizations that restrict Claude Tag by role; the manager role now also grants Claude Tag in Slack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Claude Tag] Fixed custom connectors whose MCP servers share one host showing as a single connector in Claude Tag admin settings; each server is now its own connector&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Claude Tag] Fixed Claude in Slack sometimes answering a direct message with &quot;DMs are temporarily unavailable&quot; and dropping it when a single Slack lookup stalled; it now retries first&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Claude Tag] Fixed direct messages with Claude on a Slack Enterprise Grid ignoring Slack&#39;s workspace dropdown; they now run under the connected workspace you last opened Claude in&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Claude Tag] Fixed Claude in Slack&#39;s notice for a channel&#39;s monthly spend limit saying a channel manager can raise it; it now names an organization owner and links the usage page&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Claude Tag] Fixed links in Claude&#39;s Slack replies absorbing the closing bold or italic marks, or full-width punctuation, right after them, which broke the link and the formatting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Claude Tag] Improved repository search in Claude Tag admin settings to cover up to 100 connected GitHub accounts and find private repositories past the first 5,000 of a GitHub App install&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Claude Tag] Improved Add place in Claude Tag admin settings to list a channel you type or paste right away, instead of only after your organization&#39;s full channel list has loaded&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Claude Tag] Improved Add &amp;gt; Domain on a workspace&#39;s or channel&#39;s page in Claude Tag admin settings to be available once that page loads, not only after every channel has loaded&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Claude Tag] Changed Claude Tag admin settings to organize Claude&#39;s access into four tabs: Bundles, Connectors, Skills and plugins, and Channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Claude Tag] Changed the Roles page in organization settings to group the roles created for Claude Tag channel managers in a collapsed section below your organization&#39;s own roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Code Review] Fixed Code Review setup not resuming after you leave to connect GitHub; back in admin settings, it now reopens at the repository picker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
    <author>
      <name>ashwin-ant</name>
    </author>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178951676?s=60&amp;v=4"/>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/937253475/v2.1.301</id>
    <updated>2026-10-15T19:22:06Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.301"/>
    <title>v2.1.301</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;CLAUDE_CODE_RETRY_WATCHDOG_MAX_USAGE_LIMIT_WAIT_MS&lt;/code&gt; so unattended retry mode (&lt;code&gt;CLAUDE_CODE_RETRY_WATCHDOG&lt;/code&gt;) ends a request at a usage limit that resets too far away instead of waiting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added OpenTelemetry tracing guidance to the &lt;code&gt;claude-api&lt;/code&gt; skill, including setting up trace destinations with the &lt;code&gt;ant&lt;/code&gt; CLI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added the &lt;code&gt;%&lt;/code&gt; motion to vim mode: jump to the matching bracket, alone or with d/c/y&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;rows&lt;/code&gt; to a mod&#39;s &lt;code&gt;Input&lt;/code&gt;: a text field of several lines in the terminal, where Enter submits and Shift+Enter or a backslash before Enter starts a new line&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;classifier_verdict&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;permission_mode&lt;/code&gt; to OpenTelemetry &lt;code&gt;tool_decision&lt;/code&gt; events, so auto mode classifier decisions can be told apart from permission rules&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;classifier_category&lt;/code&gt; to OpenTelemetry &lt;code&gt;tool_decision&lt;/code&gt; events, naming the built-in rule a classifier block matched, when &lt;code&gt;OTEL_LOG_TOOL_DETAILS=1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed quitting removing a worktree made by a &lt;code&gt;WorktreeCreate&lt;/code&gt; hook without asking when it may hold unpushed commits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed the &lt;code&gt;fable&lt;/code&gt; (and &lt;code&gt;best&lt;/code&gt;) model alias erroring on the Anthropic API when the newest Fable model is not available to your organization: Claude Code now retries once on the previous Fable model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed a misleading &quot;Please run /login&quot; error when a full disk keeps the login from being refreshed; the error now names the disk and says to delete files&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed Grep and Glob reporting no matches when the search program failed unexpectedly before returning any results; they now return an error saying the search failed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed workflow agents sometimes skipping their step, and the run still reporting success, after reading the harness note that their task text carries no user authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed artifact updates being refused where a PreToolUse hook covers Edit or Write; Claude now edits the file and then republishes instead of changing it in the publish call&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed skills and commands with very many or very long argument names stalling for seconds when invoked; only the first 64 names, each up to 64 characters, are now filled in&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed skills, commands and hooks using very large amounts of memory when their arguments fill many placeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed stray characters such as &lt;code&gt;&amp;gt;0q&lt;/code&gt; covering the folder trust prompt, and &lt;code&gt;&amp;gt;4m&lt;/code&gt; before the shell prompt at exit, in terminals built on VTE older than 0.53 such as MATE Terminal on RHEL 8&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed stray &lt;code&gt;GOK&lt;/code&gt; text appearing in the prompt at startup in some versions of iTerm2&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed switching to a model whose name contains &lt;code&gt;application-inference-profile&lt;/code&gt; running your &lt;code&gt;awsAuthRefresh&lt;/code&gt; command and delaying model-switch hooks when the provider is not Bedrock&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed sign-in refresh timeouts and unexpected sign-outs after a short command such as &lt;code&gt;claude auth status&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code&gt;claude plugin list&lt;/code&gt; exited in the middle of a token refresh&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed a tool call cut off by a message sent mid-turn during its permission check being reported to the model as rejected by the user&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed a case where switching to a model with a smaller context window could spend usage credits on a summary by the previous model without asking first&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed conversations being compacted over and over, on a model you didn&#39;t pick, behind an LLM gateway whose responses name a different model than the one requested&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed vim mode sometimes staying in INSERT after Escape on a slow or busy machine&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed Esc discarding a typed AskUserQuestion answer in vim mode: the free-text field now supports vim NORMAL mode, and Esc cancels only from NORMAL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed the Read tool reading binary files such as .xlsm, .parquet, .epub and .heic as text&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed a Markdown table with only a header row drawing nothing when too wide for the terminal, including in plans on the plan approval card&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed the /claude-api skill saying CMEK external-key endpoints aren&#39;t available on Claude Platform on AWS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed skills no longer being listed to the model after using &lt;code&gt;/rewind&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed the compaction row in a resumed session offering ctrl+o for history that is not loaded; it now says where the earlier messages are saved, and also shows in fullscreen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed the &quot;new task? /clear to save tokens&quot; hint coming back right after you interrupt a response&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed the permission prompt for a plugin or skill hook&#39;s &lt;code&gt;ask&lt;/code&gt; decision not showing which plugin or skill the hook comes from&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed &lt;code&gt;/diff&lt;/code&gt; not noticing a conflicted cherry-pick or revert in reftable repositories when one of its git checks timed out or failed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed workflow scripts asking for permission or being refused when read, edited or re-run after a Bash &lt;code&gt;cd&lt;/code&gt; in the same session&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed dim text on the dark ANSI theme and 16-color terminals: faint inside filled boxes, not faint under selection and search highlights, and list descriptions dimmed like other secondary text&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed a mod&#39;s &lt;code&gt;$.model.fork&lt;/code&gt; returning &lt;code&gt;nothing-to-fork&lt;/code&gt; when called before the first response of a new Claude Code process had finished, as in &lt;code&gt;claude -p&lt;/code&gt; runs and cloud sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fullscreen mode: Fixed &lt;code&gt;/compact&lt;/code&gt; and auto-compact briefly freezing the UI while the visible transcript is rebuilt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-hosted runner: Fixed sessions started from Slack being unable to find or attach a repository when managed settings restrict MCP servers; use &lt;code&gt;deniedMcpServers&lt;/code&gt; to keep those tools off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-hosted runner: Fixed sessions being reported as having a deleted source branch, and not retried, when an unrelated setup or session failure quoted git&#39;s missing-ref wording&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-hosted runner: Fixed the log promising a retry of a failed or declined session release for a session that is ending; repeated failures now show a count&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Windows: Fixed stopped background PowerShell commands missing the closing &lt;code&gt;[killed]&lt;/code&gt; line in their output file&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved switching to a model with a smaller context window: a conversation too long for the new model is now summarized by the previous model first&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved rendering performance while a long-running subagent works: its progress trail now updates incrementally instead of being reprocessed in full on every render&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved artifacts: pages Claude writes now paint the band above a sticky header, so scrolled text no longer shows there in the mobile apps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved mods: in VS Code and the desktop and mobile apps, a tree drawn above the question dialog can now hold Markdown and up to 48 rows; the terminal keeps 12 plain rows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changed a mod hook&#39;s &lt;code&gt;.catch&lt;/code&gt; handler to run only when the hook throws or times out; events raised beneath the hook&#39;s own calls now skip that hook without asking its &lt;code&gt;.catch&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changed a mod&#39;s &lt;code&gt;$.env.set&lt;/code&gt; to resolve with &lt;code&gt;{}&lt;/code&gt; once the variable is set or unset, or with &lt;code&gt;{ deny }&lt;/code&gt; saying why when the write is not made&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Added LaTeX math rendering in Claude&#39;s responses, including &lt;code&gt;$$&lt;/code&gt; and multi-line &lt;code&gt;\[ … \]&lt;/code&gt; blocks and inline &lt;code&gt;$…$&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;\(…\)&lt;/code&gt; math&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Added a &quot;Get more usage&quot; link to the usage-limit banner for Pro and Max plans in the VS Code and JetBrains panels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Fixed a conversation that crashes or freezes the panel being reopened on every reload&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Fixed the chat panel slowing down during long thinking: it no longer re-parses the whole thinking text on every update&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Fixed diagnostics showing &quot;[object Object]&quot; instead of the rule code (e.g. MD013) for some language servers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[VSCode] Fixed the native dictation audio module being loaded, to check microphone permission, where dictation is not offered (non-claude.ai sign-ins, remote windows)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
